  "sn55.3:1.2": "This is Dīghāvu’s only appearance in the Suttas. A fabled wise prince of the same name features in a long Vinaya story (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-kd10/en/sujato#2.3.1'>Kd 10:2.3.1</a>). ",
  "sn55.3:1.3": "This is also Jotika’s only appearance. ",
