  "sn55.3:3.1": "As well as this set of “four factors of stream-entry”, we find a complementary set (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn55.5/en/sujato'>SN 55.5</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn55.50/en/sujato'>SN 55.50</a>). In a later text the two are distinguished (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn33/en/sujato#1.11.108'>DN 33:1.11.108</a>). ",
  "sn55.3:3.2": "",
  "sn55.3:3.3": "",
  "sn55.3:3.4": "",
  "sn55.3:3.5": "",
  "sn55.3:3.6": "",
  "sn55.3:3.7": "See <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an6.35/en/sujato'>AN 6.35</a> and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn46.71/en/sujato'>SN 46.71</a>–76. ",
  "sn55.3:3.8": "",
